    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Ballard",
            "Let me start from the beginning. After the disruption at the Hetero Tower, I realized it was the change I'd been waiting for.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
            "The disruption plunged the once-stable Babylonia into chaos, and Kurono had never been so vulnerable.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
            "Do you know that they have yet to replace all the junior officers they lost?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
            "The emergence of the Clean Zone afterward was unexpected, obviously, but it didn't matter. It just meant that the engineering chips we collected years ago could be put to use.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
            "Compared to the trigger-happy Babylonia, we have an advantage in restarting those production and gathering lines.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
            "The resources and connections I've secretly gathered over decades would be converted into a military power that could stand against Babylonia at a breakneck pace.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
            "The only variable that could hinder my plan...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He looks at the person on the other end of the table."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
            "...Was you, Watanabe.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Ballard",
